WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.033
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.334
Welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:06.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:07.801
You guys,
I'm so excited about this.

00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:09.701
From the mega hit show,
"Stranger Things,"

00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:12.434
Millie Bobby Brown
is my guest tonight!

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:14.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:17.000
My fave.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.701
Well,
speaking of "stranger things,"

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:20.434
Kanye West is in the news.

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:23.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.767
After losing his deal
with Adidas,

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.567
Kanye showed up,
unannounced, yesterday

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:30.100
at Skechers headquarters
and was escorted out.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:33.400
That's too bad,
'cause if there's one company

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.300
that could help him "shape up,"
it's Skechers.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.467
You know, you'd think --

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:42.501
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:45.367
Yeah, when Kanye showed up,
the CEO said, "Call security."

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:46.834
And his assistant was like,
"This is Skechers.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:50.801
We don't have security."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.300
I feel like, pretty soon,
Kanye's gonna hit up

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.767
whoever makes those
free paper sandals

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:54.901
after you get a pedicure.

00:00:54.901 --> 00:01:01.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:05.601
Speaking of "stranger things,"
Elon Musk is in the news.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:08.100
Elon Musk is close to buying
Twitter, and, yesterday,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.000
