headquarters carrying a sink

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.334
just so that he could tweet --
this is real --

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:15.901
"Entering Twitter HQ.
Let that sink in."

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:19.734
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:22.934
-Come on.

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:26.067
-That pun cost him $44 billion.

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:29.267
Worth it?
I think so.

00:01:29.267 --> 00:01:31.467
Just when you thought Kanye
made the most bizarre entrance,

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:33.701
Elon was like, "Hold my sink."
You know?

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:37.934
Well, you guys, Halloween
is just a few days away.

00:01:37.934 --> 00:01:38.901
You excited about Halloween?

00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:42.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:44.701
I read that the top three
candies in the U.S.

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:48.033
are Reese's, Skittles,
and M&amp;M's.

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:49.167
Those are all pretty solid.

00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:50.767
Tariq,
what's your favorite candy?

00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:53.000
-Mine?
I like Junior Mints.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.467
-Mm.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:58.467
-Swedish Fish?

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:00.667
-Nah, bish.

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:01.667
-Wax lips?

00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:03.033
-Goes to my hips.

00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:04.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.601
-Starburst?

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:07.634
-Could be worse.

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:10.234
