-I ain't a hater.

00:02:10.234 --> 00:02:11.300
-Mike and Ike?

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:12.534
-I do not like.

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:13.567
-Raisinets?

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:14.567
-I would not get.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.634
-Red Vines?
-Always divine.

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:17.667
-Lifesavers?

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:18.901
-Every flavor.

00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:19.801
-Bit-O-Honey?

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:20.868
-Ha-ha! You're funny.

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.968
-Dum Dums?
-Yum, yum, yum.

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:24.100
-Jujubes?

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.100
-Bitch, please!

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:31.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:32.234
-Goo Goo Cluster?

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:33.534
-Hell yeah, mother [bleep]

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:35.400
-Cotton candy?
-Sweetie, go!

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.467
-♪ Let me see that
tootsie roll ♪

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.868
♪ Oh, tootsie roll ♪

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:41.701
♪ Tootsie roll ♪

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:45.434
♪ Tootsie roll,
let me see that tootsie roll ♪

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:51.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.701 --> 00:02:56.167
-All that for just --

00:02:56.167 --> 00:02:58.868
-Switching gears, uh...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.868 --> 00:03:01.334
After finishing their annual
nuclear exercises,

00:03:01.334 --> 00:03:03.467
today, Vladimir Putin said
that Russia would not use

00:03:03.467 --> 00:03:05.934
nuclear weapons in Ukraine.

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:08.334
People are like, "Okay. But what
about the other countries?"

00:03:08.334 --> 00:03:10.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:12.534
Guys, of course,
it's election season,

00:03:12.534 --> 00:03:14.300
and there's a weird story
from Pennsylvania.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.434
Apparently,
a Democrat named Mike Doyle

00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:19.334
is retiring from Congress,
and the Republican candidate

00:03:19.334 --> 00:03:22.801
to replace him
is actually named Mike Doyle.

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:24.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.234 --> 00:03:26.501
While the outgoing Democrat,
Mike Doyle,

00:03:26.501 --> 00:03:29.734
doesn't want the Republican
Mike Doyle to win his seat,

00:03:29.734 --> 00:03:31.400
so he just released this ad.
Take a look.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.334
-Mike Doyle says he'll take care
of Pennsylvania voters,

00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:40.567
but can we really trust
someone like Mike Doyle?

00:03:40.567 --> 00:03:43.400
-Hi, I'm Mike Doyle,
and I'm a name you can trust,

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.701
unlike Mike Doyle.

00:03:44.701 --> 00:03:46.300
So, listen to me, Mike Doyle,

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.567
and stay the hell away
from Mike Doyle.

00:03:48.567 --> 00:03:50.734
On election day,
don't vote for this man,

00:03:50.734 --> 00:03:52.133
Mike Doyle -- no, wait.

00:03:52.133 --> 00:03:53.868
That's me.
Avoid this this guy.

00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:55.367
Wait.
Is that me or him?

00:03:55.367 --> 00:03:57.100
[Bleep]
I don't even know anymore.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.200
-This has been a message from

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:59.834
the Mike Doyle
Against Mike Doyle PAC.

00:03:59.834 --> 00:04:01.767
-Mike Doyle, Mike Doyle.

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:07.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:09.400
Well, get this, guys,
I heard that Pfizer

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.167
is being investigated
for allegedly hiding

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:13.167
more than a billion dollars
in profit

00:04:13.167 --> 00:04:15.701
