this statement, and they said...

00:04:32.267 --> 00:04:33.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:35.234
It sounds serious.
-Wow.

00:04:35.234 --> 00:04:36.934
-Pfight.
-Pfight.

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:39.367
-Pfight --
Pfight me, sorry, yeah.

00:04:39.367 --> 00:04:40.834
Well, some entertainment news.

00:04:40.834 --> 00:04:43.801
Henry Cavill says that, in his
next performance as Superman,

00:04:43.801 --> 00:04:47.601
he'll be playing a, quote,
"Enormously joyful Superman."

00:04:47.601 --> 00:04:49.968
"Enormously joyful Superman."

00:04:49.968 --> 00:04:53.434
We actually have an early clip
of enormously joyful Superman.

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:56.167
Take a look at this.

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:59.167
-I know you're trying to find
out where I hang my cape.

00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:00.634
You won't.

00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:05.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:05.667 --> 00:05:07.667
-Looks good.
I can't wait.

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:09.868
-I can't wait to see it.
-Yeah.

00:05:09.868 --> 00:05:12.567
I saw a new report that says
that people should not rake

00:05:12.567 --> 00:05:14.300
all the leaves out of their yard

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.334
because it's actually better
for your lawn's health.

00:05:17.334 --> 00:05:18.567
So, I think, with that in mind,

00:05:18.567 --> 00:05:20.767
it's time to say goodbye
to my rake.

00:05:20.767 --> 00:05:22.601
Rake, are you there?

00:05:22.601 --> 00:05:24.801
-A lifetime of autumns together

00:05:24.801 --> 00:05:28.501
and this is how I find out
I'm fired.

00:05:28.501 --> 00:05:30.234
-Come on, rake,
don't think of it as fired.

00:05:30.234 --> 00:05:32.667
Think of it as retiring.

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:34.834
You can now
do anything you want.

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:37.767
-Man, I want to rake leaves.

00:05:37.767 --> 00:05:40.634
Fall is my whole personality.

00:05:40.634 --> 00:05:42.968
-Look, your future
is what you make it.

00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:44.033
We'll see you in the spring,

00:05:44.033 --> 00:05:45.767
