to clear the flower beds.

00:05:45.767 --> 00:05:47.133
-You're right, Jimmy.

00:05:47.133 --> 00:05:49.400
Hey, we had
some good times, though.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:50.767
Remember high school?

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:52.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:52.267 --> 00:05:55.968
I used to hang out with you
and your friends.

00:05:55.968 --> 00:05:58.901
Watching you guys play hoops,

00:05:58.901 --> 00:06:01.167
