with Yoo-Hoo

00:06:09.968 --> 00:06:11.634
and call it Gator-Hoo?

00:06:11.634 --> 00:06:13.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.834 --> 00:06:17.467
Ed Zipperton.
Man, that guy was cool.

00:06:17.467 --> 00:06:20.734
He pantsed me at prom
while I was dancing alone

00:06:20.734 --> 00:06:23.100
to "Lady in Red."

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.167
It was the part where it goes...

00:06:25.167 --> 00:06:26.534
[ Laughs ]

00:06:26.534 --> 00:06:30.467
♪ The lady in red ♪

00:06:30.467 --> 00:06:32.234
-Yeah, it was.

00:06:32.234 --> 00:06:36.567
-♪ Is dancing with me ♪

00:06:36.567 --> 00:06:38.667
♪ Cheek to cheek ♪

00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:40.067
[ Laughter ]

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.467
Then, shoop!

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:44.200
That's the sound
of my pants going down.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:48.067
And the worst part is, my pants
got caught on my prom boots.

00:06:48.067 --> 00:06:51.467
Yeah, the tuxedo rental man
at the mall tricked me

00:06:51.467 --> 00:06:54.000
