00:06:58.968 --> 00:07:00.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.667 --> 00:07:01.834
Oh, wait!
I forgot.

00:07:01.834 --> 00:07:04.133
I'm supposed to be doing
the voice of a rake.

00:07:04.133 --> 00:07:05.634
[ Laughter ]

00:07:05.634 --> 00:07:09.367
Not reciting
a page from my diary.

00:07:09.367 --> 00:07:11.033
-This has been another edition

00:07:11.033 --> 00:07:13.801
of "Making James Read Lines
He's Never Seen Before."

00:07:13.801 --> 00:07:18.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:18.601 --> 00:07:22.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.467
-I miss that rake.

00:07:23.467 --> 00:07:24.701
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.701 --> 00:07:26.501
Guys, listen to this.

00:07:26.501 --> 00:07:29.367
A new study found that,
