of all listeria cases.

00:07:32.834 --> 00:07:34.567
Right now,
the CEO of Blimpie is like,

00:07:34.567 --> 00:07:36.634
"Well, that's what you get
for using real meat."

00:07:36.634 --> 00:07:38.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:38.033 --> 00:07:39.367
Well, guys,
this is very interesting.

00:07:39.367 --> 00:07:41.667
A new survey found that you can
have the best chance

00:07:41.667 --> 00:07:45.601
