00:07:50.567 --> 00:07:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:07:51.701 --> 00:07:53.067
-You know what?

00:07:53.067 --> 00:07:54.234
No.

00:07:54.234 --> 00:07:55.234
You know what?
No.

00:07:55.234 --> 00:07:57.133
I'm tired of all
the Florida slander.

00:07:57.133 --> 00:07:59.734
We always make fun of Florida,
but I'm putting my foot down.

00:07:59.734 --> 00:08:02.501
It's a great state
full of great people.

00:08:02.501 --> 00:08:04.167
-Listen to this next story.
A Florida man

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:08.901
