Florida is scary, dude.

00:08:11.934 --> 00:08:14.667
-Oh, come on. I'm sure he had
a perfectly good reason.

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:16.868
-He confessed to deputies,
saying he wanted

00:08:16.868 --> 00:08:20.133
to get back at his co-worker
for "being difficult."

00:08:20.133 --> 00:08:21.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.467 --> 00:08:23.234
-"Being difficult"?

00:08:23.234 --> 00:08:24.501
-That's just one guy.

00:08:24.501 --> 00:08:25.767
It's a random
workplace incident.

00:08:25.767 --> 00:08:27.234
Not everyone in Florida
is chasing people around,

00:08:27.234 --> 00:08:28.701
trying to hurt them.

00:08:28.701 --> 00:08:31.901
-A Florida man is accused of
chasing two people with knives.

00:08:31.901 --> 00:08:32.901
[ Laughter ]

00:08:32.901 --> 00:08:34.267
-You're done.
You're done, man.

00:08:34.267 --> 00:08:35.400
Case closed.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.934
-I mean -- I mean,
it was just only a knife.

00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:40.467
-They say he didn't stop
with the knives.

00:08:40.467 --> 00:08:41.968
He also grabbed an axe.

00:08:41.968 --> 00:08:43.033
[ Laughter ]

00:08:43.033 --> 00:08:45.567
-I'm telling you, man,
Florida is scary!

00:08:45.567 --> 00:08:47.968
-That's a fluke
between a few people.

00:08:47.968 --> 00:08:50.000
It's not like he was knocking on
doors in the wee hours

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.801
