while wielding a machete.

00:08:51.801 --> 00:08:55.067
-A man in a South Florida
neighborhood knocking on doors

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:58.901
in the wee hours of the morning
while wielding a machete.

00:08:58.901 --> 00:09:00.734
[ Laughter ]
-Come on.

00:09:00.734 --> 00:09:03.267
-Look, at least they're keeping
