00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.734
-Maybe they were -- they were
giving the food to the needy.

00:09:17.734 --> 00:09:20.033
-The men were selling the meat
on the black market.

00:09:20.033 --> 00:09:21.801
-All right, forget it!
Let's talk about something else!

00:09:21.801 --> 00:09:22.868
I'm not --

00:09:22.868 --> 00:09:27.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:27.767 --> 00:09:30.868
Finally, Essentia water
has teamed up

00:09:30.868 --> 00:09:32.334
with a boxed-wine company

00:09:32.334 --> 00:09:34.534
